Tue Apr 23 08:42:54 2024 Benjamin T. Liu
v1.48.1
Reviewers: Peter Robinson, David Dawson

bundle fixes

- do not perform any branch fetches during bundle (this should be done by grape up)

- do not pull if safeForceBranchToOriginRef called from bundle on a public branch

- check for consistency of gitlinks for submodules

- check for nested subproject tags ahead of top level

- distinguish diverged branches from missing branches

Remove prune from fetches (has the potential of affecting pipeline references)

Disable git managed credential caching by default (no longer typically used)
